{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>For</b> — the sense is the lot of the righteous — they are Israel, who inherited the land, like \"when you divide the land, by lot\"." "<b>The scepter of the wicked</b> — they are the nations of the lands. And the sense of \"so that\" is like the sense of: \"that they may not teach you.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 125, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:16.748720832Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}